      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs70KzuM",
      "title": "ops: Support super-root game types",
      "author": "ajsutton",
      "number": 1290,
      "body": "Classify respected `SUPER_PERMISSIONED` type 5 as permissioned and `SUPER_CANNON_KONA` type 9 as permissionless during codegen. Temporarily pin the optimism dependency to the head of ethereum-optimism/optimism#21928.\n\nKeep this draft until ethereum-optimism/optimism#21928 merges, then repin to the resulting `develop` commit. The PR-head module currently requires a prepared checkout because its generated, gitignored `op-core/superchain/superchain-configs.zip` is absent from a clean module download; that must also be resolved before marking this ready.\n\nTests: `go test ./internal/manage -count=1` with a temporary `go.work` replacement to the prepared optimism PR checkout.\n\nCloses https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/optimism/issues/21711",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-21T04:07:51Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-07-28T08:54:24Z",
      "additions": 83,
      "deletions": 44
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOJ_r-bs73g27B",
      "title": "chore: automated codegen update 2026-07-28",
      "author": "opgitgovernance",
      "number": 1295,
      "body": "This is an automated PR created by the daily-codegen circleci job.\n\nPlease review and merge if the changes look correct.\n\nNote that only these files should have been modified:\n\n- [addresses.json](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry/blob/main/superchain/extra/addresses/addresses.json)\n- [chainList.json](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry/blob/main/chainList.json)\n- [chainList.toml](https://github.com/ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry/blob/main/chainList.toml)\n\nFor more details see the [runbook](https://www.notion.so/oplabs/superchain-registry-daily-codegen-294f153ee162803788cdee48ec542ca4?v=d784200583d9415587c4dcd2b0c64b2f).",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-registry",
